# oracle: native binary restart (serial file) of atom_style full with harmonic bonds and angles and lj/cut/coul/long with pppm; the restarted run continues 40 steps
# oracle-inputs: w184nr_mol.restart
# native: b332f28 built as the parity binary wrote w184nr_mol.restart (chains from w184nr_mol.data, pppm 1e-4)
read_restart    w184nr_mol.restart
kspace_style    pppm 1.0e-4
neighbor        2.0 bin
thermo_style    custom step temp epair emol etotal press
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
thermo          20
fix             1 all nve
run             40
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-10 abs=1e-12
# measured: max relative error 2.8e-12 (fx of atom 13 after 40 steps; the thermo rows agree to 1e-14), so the tolerance is 1e-10
